<title>FINLAND: NOKIA RISES ABOVE FIM 400 FIRST TIME EVER.</title>
<headline>NOKIA RISES ABOVE FIM 400 FIRST TIME EVER.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Finnish telecommunications group Nokia touched 400.00 markka for the first time ever on Friday -- up 4.50 markka or 1.1 percent and tested higher levels.</p>
<p>At 1200/0900 GMT, Nokia A traded at 400.00 markka after testing 401.00 and total trade in both Nokia shares was a healthy 50 million markka.</p>
